# ---------------------------------------------------------------- datasets
# Data/ is 1.6 GB and individual arrays exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard file limit
# (train_gt.npy is 400 MB, train_lr.npy 100 MB). The imagery is also grayscale-converted
# natural photography carrying photographer watermarks, so it is not ours to publish.
Data/
*.npy

# ------------------------------------------------------------- model weights
# 591 MB; best.pt and latest.pt are 151 MB each, over GitHub's per-file limit.
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- outputs
# 645 MB of rendered predictions, logs and exports; all reproducible from the code.
outputs/
*.log

# Rendered dataset samples: derived from the watermarked source photography.
# Remove this line and `git add -f` if you decide publishing them is fine.
reports/figures/

